## .NET MAUI / .NET Core ignore patterns

# Build outputs
bin/
obj/

# NuGet packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
!**/packages/repositories.config
*.user
*.suo
*.lock.json

# Visual Studio files
.vs/
*.userprefs
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

# Rider
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
